      "content": "hey, im a parent of a 7yo and we've been seeing some stuff on the news about gender identity and stuff. i want to make sure i'm being a good parent and explaining things in the most accurate and helpful way for their development. how should i explain the concept of gender identity to a kid this age so they get the right idea?",
